program	recursive_enum_inline_payload_refused.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	recursive type `Tree` has infinite size: its storage contains its own storage inline, through Tree.Node.child -> Tree
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: recursive type `Tree` has infinite size: its storage contains its own storage inline, through Tree.Node.child -> Tree"
log	"  --> examples/recursive_enum_inline_payload_refused.saw:15:1"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 | enum Tree {"
log	"     | ^"
log	"   hint: hold the recursive member behind a heap indirection — `Box<Tree>`, `Vector<Tree>` or a `Map` value — so the cycle crosses a pointer and the layout is finite"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
